From b6592ab9e0f71da0e7b486b525f915f1eb8cd657 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Bright <william.bright@imd-tec.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:58:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: qcs8550-imdt-sbc: Add AR1335 overlays for
 CSI4 to CSI7

CSI4 to CSI7 share the always-on camera I2C bus, CCI1 bus 1 on the AON
CCI pins, through a TCA9546 switch at 0x74 with one channel per
connector. Each overlay adds the bus, the switch and its sensor on the
right channel, with MCLK4 to MCLK7 and the reset GPIOs from the IMDT
CamX device tree:

  CSI4  channel 0  MCLK4 (AON)  GPIO120
  CSI5  channel 1  MCLK5        GPIO69
  CSI6  channel 2  MCLK6        GPIO71
  CSI7  channel 3  MCLK7        GPIO109

The switch runs from the camera 1.8 V rail and its reset is pulled up
on the board.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: William Bright <william.bright@imd-tec.com>
